/E (Hello, my name is Tabitha Sulaiman, a 4th year pursuing a Bachelors in Computer Science. I am honored to be serving as the President of the California State University Northridge \(CSUN\) Chapter of the National Society Of Black Engineers \(NSBE\) in the 2025-26 school year.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
