/Pg 9 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
167 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The National Society Of Black Engineers was founded due to the lack of support for young Black minds in the STEM/Engineering field. There was an alarmingly high number of dropouts amongst the Black freshmen within the Engineering department in college/universities. NSBE can be seen as the backbone for the majority of all of today's Black Engineers.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Despite challenges faced in recent years, CSUN-NSBE remains steadfast in its commitment to "increase the number of culturally responsible Black engineers, who excel academically, succeed professionally, and positively impact their communities".)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our primary objective is to revive our chapter and to create an environment catered to improving and increasing the number of Black engineers at CSUN by promoting academic, professional, and cultural success.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
170 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (CSUN-NSBE eagerly seeks your partnership in our endeavors to create an inclusive environment where our members can succeed as Black students, engineers, and people. Your potential donations will play a pivotal role in supporting our members' academic and professional journeys. But it doesn't just start at the collegiate level, CSUN-NSBE plans to extend our efforts towards fostering the young Black minds from our local high school and middle schools in the LA/LA County.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
171 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Doing so, will help encourage Black students to be more confident and go into the engineering/STEM field. As you wish for more diversity and inclusion, Black students need to be aware of the support system dedicated to providing them with the appropriate resources needed in order to develop interest in the STEM/Engineering fields.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Similar to our go-getter culture here at CSUN, CSUN-NSBE is implementing leadership training, critical thinking, scholastic and professional zeal, all while using these skills to give back to our community. We understand that we are responsible for molding the next generation of innovators, consultants, programmers, doctors, etc.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [13]
>>
