253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (The Fall Regional Conference \(FRC\) is our region's very own mini-Convention before the entire Society reconvenes for Annual Convention in the spring. During FRC, you can expect to see revolutionary programming and workshops that will focus on cultural development, financial literacy, leadership development, academic success and much more. Additionally, FRC will see opportunities for Region II's membership to further their professional careers at our Career Fair where they will be able to connect with companies seeking interns and full-time employees.)
/E (The Fall Regional Conference \(FRC\) is our region's very own mini-Convention before the entire Society reconvenes for Annual Convention in the spring. During FRC, you can expect to see revolutionary programming and workshops that will focus on cultural development, financial literacy, leadership development, academic success and much more. Additionally, FRC will see opportunities for Region II's membership to further their professional careers at our Career Fair where they will be able to connect with companies seeking interns and full-time employees.)
