/T (The Annual Convention showcases Black students and professionals who have a passion for Science, Technology, Engineering and Math \(STEM\), who are high achievers in these fields and who are channeling their dedication to advance their communities and society at large. The convention usually 15,000 aspiring and practicing engineers, educators, representatives of more than 200 academic institutions, government agencies, corporations and nonprofit organizations.  )
